     "value": "Monomer. Interacts with LRPPRC (PubMed:11827465). May interact with BCL2L1; an interaction with BCL2L1 was observed using a peptide, but not with the full-length protein (PubMed:21639858). The full-length protein would have to undergo a major conformation change for the interaction to occur (PubMed:21639858). Interacts with PDCD6 (PubMed:27784779)"
